  <data-orientation>
    <data-orientation-item>
      <simple-id uuid='{5AA53BB0-0ABD-49A1-9CDF-8708DA04C301}' />
      <desc>The Stock Price Prediction Dashboard provides an interactive, unified view comparing actual stock performance against model-predicted values across key equities (SBI, HDFC Bank, TCS, and Reliance). Designed for clear comparative analysis, this dashboard enables users to evaluate model accuracy, observe trading volume relationships, and track price trends over custom date ranges.

Key Components
Close Price Trend Over Time (Line Chart - Top Left): Displays historical closing price movements for each stock over time, color-coded by stock name to identify long-term trends and price momentum.

Volume vs. Predicted Price (Scatter Plot - Top Right): Examines the relationship between trading volume and predicted stock valuations to spot high-activity patterns or potential prediction outliers.

Predicted Price by Stock (Highlight Table - Bottom): Presents direct numerical predicted valuations and model performance indicators color-coded by magnitude for quick visual comparison across stocks.

</desc>
    </data-orientation-item>
  </data-orientation>
</workbook>
